# Docker build context for v2 images. An allowlist: everything is excluded, then only what an
# image is built from is let back in, so a new directory is excluded until someone decides
# otherwise (PLAN 6.1, "Build and CI").
#
# Never in the context: generated releases and the store (var/), and v1's own files that hold
# FRED- and Yahoo-sourced values (data/, dist/, web/, .git). tests/v2/test_ignore_rules.py
# checks this file. Do not add those paths here; a milestone that seems to need them is parked
# and reported to Alex (build protocol, point 7).
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages
!site
!schema

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.local
